        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "继续"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS refused this — try moving Codenotch to /Applications.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 拒绝了 — 试着把 Codenotch 移到「应用程序」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "via %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "来自 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign in to %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign in to %@ to read this account.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录 %@ 以读取此账号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign in with %@ to read this account.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用 %@ 登录以读取此账号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign out in the %@ window to use another account.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 %@ 窗口里退出，才能换另一个账号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch accounts in %@; the notch follows.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 %@ 里切换账号，刘海会跟上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch accounts in the tool that owns it; the notch follows.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在持有该账号的工具里切换，刘海会跟上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Signs out of %@ — the session belongs to Codenotch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会退出 %@ — 这个会话属于 Codenotch。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You stay signed in to %@ — end that session in %@ itself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你在 %@ 里仍然是登录状态 — 要结束会话，去 %@ 里操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You stay signed in to the tool that owns the account.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你在持有该账号的工具里仍然是登录状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign in with the tool that owns this account.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用持有此账号的工具登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign in to %@…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录 %@…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run grok login — it signs in and refreshes the token this reads.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "运行 grok login — 它会登录并刷新这里读取的令牌。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Usage rides on the opencode-go key OpenCode stores on sign-in — connect Go inside OpenCode (`opencode auth login`) and the notch reads it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用量走的是 OpenCode 登录时保存的 opencode-go 密钥 — 在 OpenCode 里接通 Go（`opencode auth login`），刘海就会读到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Usage rides on a Z.ai GLM Coding Plan key held by a coding tool — Claude Code's settings.json, ZCode or OpenCode. Set one up there and the notch reads it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用量走的是某个编程工具里的 Z.ai GLM Coding Plan 密钥 — Claude Code 的 settings.json、ZCode 或 OpenCode。在那边配好，刘海就会读到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run `%@` once — it signs in and refreshes the token this reads. Use /login there to change account.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先运行一次 `%@` — 它会登录并刷新这里读取的令牌。要换账号，在那里用 /login。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlimited on the %@ plan — nothing to meter": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 套餐无限制 — 没有可计量的额度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ plan has nothing for Cursor to meter yet": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 套餐目前还没有可供 Cursor 计量的额度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex reported no usage windows": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex 没有返回任何用量窗口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No OpenCode Go subscription on this key": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个密钥上没有 OpenCode Go 订阅"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grok has nothing metered on this account yet": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个 Grok 账号目前没有可计量的额度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quit Codenotch": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出 Codenotch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep open": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保持展开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Refresh now": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "立即刷新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codenotch is set to Always show. Change it in Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codenotch 已设为「始终显示」。请在设置里更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在检查…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codenotch is up to date.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codenotch 已是最新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@ is available and will install shortly.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本 %@ 可用，即将安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't reach the update server. Codenotch will try again on its own — nothing is wrong with this copy.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连不上更新服务器。Codenotch 会自己再试 — 这份安装没有问题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two more providers, and a live account plan that was silently dropped.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "又多了两个服务，以及一个被悄悄丢掉的真实账号套餐。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grok is a new ring": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grok 成了新的圆环"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SuperGrok's weekly Grok Build allowance, read from the same billing endpoint the CLI uses, with the session in ~/.grok/auth.json.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SuperGrok 的每周 Grok Build 额度，读取 CLI 所用的同一个计费接口，会话来自 ~/.grok/auth.json。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenCode's Go plan is a new ring": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenCode 的 Go 套餐成了新的圆环"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads the Go plan's official usage endpoint with the key OpenCode itself stores on sign-in — no second sign-in.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用 OpenCode 登录时自己存下的密钥读取 Go 套餐官方用量接口 — 不用再登一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A real Codex account went unmetered": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个真实的 Codex 账号变成了未计量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex's live reading only recognised a 5-hour and a 7-day window. A free-plan account's real limit was a 30-day one, which fell through unnoticed and showed as nothing metered on an account that was genuinely tracked.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex 的实时读数只认 5 小时和 7 天窗口。免费套餐账号真正的额度是 30 天，被悄悄漏掉，一个确实在计量的账号显示成没有可计量的额度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switching a provider off now really stops it": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关掉某个服务现在真的会停掉"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opening Settings could still read a switched-off provider's account, and a reply already in flight could restore a reading you had just asked it to forget.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开设置仍可能读取已关闭服务的账号，一次还在路上的回复也可能把你刚让它忘掉的读数加回来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Contributors can build without a certificate": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "贡献者可以在没有证书的情况下构建"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "make build and make test now sign themselves automatically when the maintainer's Developer ID isn't present — no Apple account needed to work on this.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "维护者的 Developer ID 不在时，make build 和 make test 会自动签名 — 参与开发不需要 Apple 账号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waking from sleep no longer erases a reading.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从睡眠唤醒不再抹掉读数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A ring survives waking your Mac": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "唤醒 Mac 后圆环还在"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A brief window right after sleep, where macOS won't allow a keychain prompt yet, was mistaken for being signed out — which erased the reading and left \"waiting for the first reading\" on screen. It now ages the number instead of throwing it away, and picks back up on its own.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刚睡醒的一小段时间里 macOS 还不允许钥匙串提示，这被误当成已退出 — 读数被抹掉，屏幕上只剩「正在等待首次读数」。现在会让数字变旧而不是扔掉，并自己恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two more accounts, four community fixes, and honest duplicates.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "又多了两个账号，四个社区修复，以及诚实的重复项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Multiple Claude Code accounts": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "多个 Claude Code 账号"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep a work login apart with CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR? It now gets its own ring, its own limits, and its own row in Settings, beside your personal one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用 CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR 把工作登录分开？它现在有自己的圆环、自己的额度，以及设置里自己的一行，就在个人账号旁边。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GLM added": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "加入了 GLM"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Z.ai's Coding Plan reads live now too, with a key borrowed from whichever tool already holds one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Z.ai 的 Coding Plan 现在也实时读取，密钥借自已经持有它的那个工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A stuck Claude ring recovers on its own": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "卡住的 Claude 圆环会自己恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One momentary failure — the Mac waking from sleep, most often — used to lock the ring until the app restarted. It now clears itself on the next check.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一次短暂失败 — 多半是 Mac 从睡眠唤醒 — 以前会把圆环锁死直到重启应用。现在下次检查会自己解开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cursor sessions stop reporting work that already ended": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cursor 会话不再把已经结束的工作报成还在进行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A crashed or abandoned chat could read as \"still working\" for a day or more. It now notices when the writing has actually stopped.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "崩溃或弃掉的对话可能一整天都显示「仍在工作」。现在会发现写入其实已经停了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A months-old duplicate can no longer win": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "几个月前的重复项再也抢不赢"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code files a new keychain entry on every token rotation. An account signed in for a while could pick an old, expired one at random and show \"waiting for the first reading\" forever.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code 每次轮换令牌都会写一条新的钥匙串。登录较久的账号可能随机拿到过期的那条，然后永远显示「正在等待首次读数」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A stray click no longer pins the notch open": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "误点不再把刘海钉在展开状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clicking near the screen edge before the notch had even opened could leave it stuck open with nothing on screen explaining why.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刘海还没展开时点到屏幕边缘，可能让它卡在打开状态，屏幕上却没有任何解释。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex reads live, and Always show stays on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex 改为实时读取，「始终显示」会保持打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex is read live instead of from a log": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex 改为实时读取，而不再读日志"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The figure came from a file Codex writes during a turn, so it was as old as the last time you used it — three days stale in one case. Codenotch now asks Codex itself, and matches its own panel.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数字来自 Codex 在一轮对话里写的文件，所以有多旧取决于你上次用它是什么时候 — 有一次旧了三天。Codenotch 现在直接问 Codex，并与它自己的面板一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Codex ring notices the desktop app": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex 圆环会注意到桌面应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It only ever watched the files the CLI and the VS Code extension write, so work done in the desktop app never made it spin.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以前只盯 CLI 和 VS Code 扩展写的文件，桌面应用里的工作从不会让它转起来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always show no longer turns itself off": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「始终显示」不再自己关掉"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clicking the notch toggled the same flag the setting used, so a stray click quietly put it back to showing on hover.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击刘海会拨动设置用的同一个开关，一次误点就会悄悄变回悬停时显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Far fewer keychain prompts": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "钥匙串提示少得多"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a token expired, every check went back to the keychain — a prompt a minute. It now reads the secret only when the owning app has changed it, and never retries a refusal on a timer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "令牌一过期，每次检查都回到钥匙串 — 一分钟弹一次。现在只在所属应用改过密钥时才读，并且不会按定时器重试一次拒绝。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A paused limit is shown as paused": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂停的额度会显示为暂停"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some limits are reached while the headline still shows room. The ring reads as spent and says when it lifts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有些额度已经用尽，标题却还显示有余量。圆环会显示用完，并说明何时解除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Long messages are no longer cut off": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "长消息不再被截断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tooltip with something to explain reserved one line for it however much it said.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有话要说的提示只给它留了一行，不管它写了多少。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every session, and a tooltip that fits on the screen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一个会话，以及一张能放进屏幕的提示卡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tooltips are no longer cut off": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提示卡不再被截断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A card is centred on the ring it belongs to, so the first and last providers threw half of it past the end of the panel — and what fell off was the title. The panel now keeps room for it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "卡片以所属圆环为中心，第一个和最后一个服务会把一半甩出面板 — 掉出去的还是标题。面板现在会给它留位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As many sessions as your screen can hold": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕能放下多少会话就显示多少"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The list was capped at four whatever you were running on. It is now solved for the display: ten on a large one, and \"and N more\" only when there is genuinely no room for the rest.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不论你在跑什么，列表以前最多四条。现在按屏幕算：大屏幕十条，只有真的放不下时才出现「还有 N 个」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ones that need you come first": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要你的排在前面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting, then busy, then idle — so if anything is summarised away, it is what matters least.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待中，然后工作中，然后空闲 — 被收进「还有 N 个」的，是最不要紧的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Antigravity's real numbers, and a switch that stays off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Antigravity 的真实数字，以及一个会保持关闭的开关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Antigravity shows its actual quota": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Antigravity 显示真实配额"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Google will not answer Codenotch directly, so it asks Antigravity's own language server instead — the same place Antigravity's usage panel gets its figure.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Google 不会直接回答 Codenotch，所以改问 Antigravity 自己的语言服务器 — 也就是 Antigravity 用量面板取数字的地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Usage reads both ways": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用量从两头都能读懂"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"12% used · 88% left\", so a reading lines up with whichever end your vendor happens to show.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「12% 已用 · 88% 剩余」，读数能对上供应商碰巧展示的那一端。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A way back from a declined keychain prompt": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拒绝钥匙串提示之后还有退路"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Declining no longer looks like being signed out, and Allow access… asks macOS again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拒绝不再看起来像已退出，「允许访问…」会再问一次 macOS。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switching a provider off now sticks": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关掉某个服务现在会记住"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It stopped being read but its last reading was kept, so the ring came back at the next launch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不再读取，但上次读数还留着，所以下次启动圆环又回来了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Distant resets show a date": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "很远的重置会显示日期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A limit renewing in four weeks said \"Mon\", which read as this Monday. It says \"28 Sep\".": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "四周后才更新的额度以前写「Mon」，读起来像本周一。现在写「9月28日」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first release.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首个版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Put the notch anywhere": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刘海可以放在任意一边"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Right, left, top or bottom. It keeps clear of the Dock and the menu bar, and follows when the Dock moves.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "右、左、上或下。会避开程序坞和菜单栏，程序坞移动时跟着走。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It joins your Mac's own notch": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它会接上 Mac 自己的刘海"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the top edge it takes the hardware's shape, so the two read as one rather than as a bar parked underneath.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "放在顶部时会采用硬件的形状，两者读起来是一块，而不是停在下面的一条。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude, Cursor, Codex and Gemini": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude、Cursor、Codex 和 Gemini"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each read from the tool already signed in on this Mac. Codenotch never asks for a password.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各自读取这台 Mac 上已经登录的工具。Codenotch 从不问密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose where Codenotch appears": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择 Codenotch 出现在哪里"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the Dock, in the menu bar, or nowhere at all.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在程序坞、在菜单栏，或者哪里都不出现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codenotch": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codenotch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@%% Used · %@%% left": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@%% 已用 · %@%% 剩余"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ left": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "剩余 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ used": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已用 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign in with GitHub CLI to read your Copilot usage": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用 GitHub CLI 登录以读取 Copilot 用量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign in with GitHub CLI using `gh auth login`, then enable GitHub Copilot.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用 `gh auth login` 登录 GitHub CLI，然后启用 GitHub Copilot。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GitHub Copilot reported no metered quotas": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub Copilot 没有返回可计量的配额"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is nothing to sign in to: the count is added up from what Gemini CLI, OpenCode and Hermes recorded about their own calls. Your API key is never read.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有需要登录的地方：次数是从 Gemini CLI、OpenCode 和 Hermes 自己记录的调用加总的。不会读取你的 API 密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Gemini CLI, OpenCode or Hermes sessions found": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有找到 Gemini CLI、OpenCode 或 Hermes 会话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run `%@` once — it signs in and is what these readings come from. Use /login there to change account.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先运行一次 `%@` — 它会登录，读数就来自那里。要换账号，在那里用 /login。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scoped": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "限定范围"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto usage": {
