    "Codenotch reads usage from tools already signed in on this Mac — it never asks for your password. Install and sign in to any of Claude Code (the terminal tool, not the Claude app), Cursor (the editor or cursor-agent), Codex, Antigravity, GLM, Grok, OpenCode, Command Code, GitHub Copilot, Kimi Code, Kiro, the Kilo CLI or a Gemini API key (via Gemini CLI, OpenCode or Hermes), and its ring appears in the notch.": {
